3715 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The current VOX booking experience follows a linear\054 venue\055specific journey\054 making it difficult for users to change cinemas once they have started booking\056 When users reach the seat\055selection stage and find limited availability\054 there is no clear way to explore or compare another venue without leaving the flow\056\n\nThis creates a loss\055of\055context problem\072 users may have to repeat earlier steps\054 lose their booking progress\054 and mentally track information from the previous venue\056 For a time\055sensitive\054 high\055intent task like cinema booking\054 this adds unnecessary cognitive load and increases the risk of flow abandonment\056\n\nHow might we let users compare and switch venues at any point before payment\054 without losing their progress or confidence in the booking\077)
     /K [ 81 ]
     /P 3716 0 R
     /Pg 3553 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

